/ Sum inputs until a zero is entered, then print the total.
/
/   $ marie run examples/sum.mas
/   5 10 27 0  ->  42

        Clear
        Store Total
Loop,   Input
        Skipcond 400        / stop when the value is zero
        Jump  Accumulate
        Load  Total
        Output
        Halt
Accumulate, Add Total
        Store Total
        Jump  Loop
Total,  DEC 0
